```gitignore
### Java & JVM ###
*.class
*.log
*.ctxt
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

### Build Tools (Maven & Gradle) ###
# Maven
target/
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.versionsBackup
pom.xml.next
release.properties
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
buildNumber.properties
.mvn/timing.properties
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# Gradle
.gradle/
build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

### IDE (IntelliJ IDEA) ###
.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
.idea_modules/

### OS & Temp files ###
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
```
